{"v":1,"code":"5271","name":"PECCA","long_name":"Pecca Group Berhad","updated":"2026-11-27 04:10","hash":"9da8014350854552","recent":"Pecca 在 2026 年 11 月 18 日召开第 16 届常年股东大会，所有决议均获通过，并于同日公布 2027 财年第一季度业绩，净利按年下滑 28.4%，同时宣布每股 1.5 仙的首次中期股息。公司也分别于 10 月 6 日和 11 月 20 日签署谅解备忘录，并持续布局航空内饰翻新与维修业务。","notable":["公布 2027 财年第一季度业绩，净利按年下滑 28.4% 至约 1,100 万令吉。","宣布 2027 财年首次中期单层股息每股 1.5 仙。","第 16 届常年股东大会所有决议均以投票方式通过。"],"risks":["季度净利按年下滑 28.4%，主要受汽车订单走弱影响。","净利率由上一季的 22.5% 降至 20.9%。"],"earnings":"2026 财年末季（截至 6 月 30 日）营收为 5,158 万令吉，按年减少 2.4%，按季增长 15.2%；净利为 1,080 万令吉，按年减少 20.1%，按季增长 7.0%；净利率为 20.9%，低于上一季的 22.5%。","facts":{"period":"2026-06-30","currency":"MYR","revenue":51583000.0,"net_income":10796000.0,"net_margin":20.9,"revenue_qoq":15.2,"net_income_qoq":7.0,"revenue_yoy":-2.4,"net_income_yoy":-20.1,"net_margin_prev":22.5,"loss":false},"ann":[{"id":"11706111","date":"2026-11-20","title":"MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11706111","cat":"corporate","tag":"notable","why":"签署谅解备忘录","why_en":"MOU signed"},{"id":"11705051","date":"2026-11-19","title":"PECCA - Notice of Book Closure","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11705051","cat":"corporate","tag":"routine","why":"股息除权通知","why_en":"Dividend book closure"},{"id":"11704471","date":"2026-11-18","title":"Change in Nomination and Remuneration Committee - DATUK LEONG KAM WENG","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11704471","cat":"other","tag":"routine","why":"提名委员会变动","why_en":"Nomination committee change"},{"id":"11704425","date":"2026-11-18","title":"Change in Nomination and Remuneration Committee - DATO' SERI DR CHEN CHAW MIN","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11704425","cat":"other","tag":"routine","why":"提名委员会变动","why_en":"Nomination committee change"},{"id":"11704449","date":"2026-11-18","title":"Change in Nomination and Remuneration Committee - MADAM YONG HUI NEE","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/annou