/www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11704327","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-18","type":"payment","what":"首次中期股息派发日","what_en":"Payment date for first interim dividend","ann":"11705051","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11705051","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-18","type":"payment","what":"首次中期股息派发日","what_en":"Payment date for first interim dividend","ann":"11704327","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11704327","src":"ai"}],"recent_en":"Pecca held its 16th AGM on 18 November 2026, where all resolutions were passed, and announced its 1Q FY2027 results the same day with net profit down 28.4% year-on-year, while declaring a first interim dividend of 1.5 sen per share. The company also signed memoranda of understanding on 6 October and 20 November, and continues to build its aviation cabin refurbishment and MRO business.","notable_en":["Announced 1Q FY2027 results with net profit down 28.4% year-on-year to about RM11 million.","Declared a first interim single-tier dividend of 1.5 sen per share for FY2027.","All resolutions at the 16th AGM were passed by poll."],"risks_en":["Quarterly net profit fell 28.4% year-on-year, mainly due to weaker automotive orders.","Net margin declined to 20.9% from 22.5% in the previous quarter."],"earnings_en":"For the final quarter of FY2026 (ended 30 June), revenue was RM51.58 million, down 2.4% year-on-year but up 15.2% quarter-on-quarter; net profit was RM10.80 million, down 20.1% year-on-year but up 7.0% quarter-on-quarter; net margin was 20.9%, lower than 22.5% in the previous quarter."}